1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
1. Blue serves the live traffic
The Blue environment runs v1. Green is separate and does not receive live requests.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:30,000
2. Prepare and check Green
Deploy v2 to Green and test it there. Users still reach Blue.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:45,000
3. Switch the route
Change the routing configuration to send new live requests to Green. Blue stays available as a standby.

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:00,000
4. Keep a rollback window
Observe Green before retiring Blue. Routing back is an option only if data and other changes remain compatible.
